# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the NP9 long-answer window (tp4/np9-answer32k; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/np9-answer32k and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-np9-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (sed -i 's/tp4-np9-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file
# the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# C2_MODEL_REPO / C2_MODEL_REVISION (qwen_c2_checkpoint.py): a job that carries them serves the Swift checkpoint with its own converted-weight directory (never the base's) and, since NP9, the output ceiling of its
# catalog entry (qwen_c2_checkpoints.json "request": output_budget 32768, default_max_tokens 16384). A job without them is the base: its ceiling is the profile's 16,384, so the long-answer tests would read as clamped.
# B0 (STOP): the WINDOW image tp4-np9-1, built from the pushed tp4/np9-answer32k head (= tp4/swift plus the output ceiling): the approved ship-4 profile
# c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic-s4 baked as the serving default with a session cap of 8, plus C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ. The image serves the BASE
# unless a job names a checkpoint; qwen_c2_checkpoint.py and qwen_c2_checkpoints.json (whose Swift entry carries the output_budget) are in it (the overlay manifest). READ:
# "baking the serving default c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic-s4 with a session cap of 8", the provenance report with no problem line, its K64j-OQ
# graft line, the image id. A build, not a card job; no privileged builder container may be up and no card job may run during it. Estimate from the last builds: 35-40
# minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-np9-1
C2_BAKE_DEFAULT_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic-s4
C2_BAKE_GRAFT=K64j-OQ
